    "None affecting the allowlist, the forbidden-source list, or the output contract.",
    "Note on tier semantics: tier_3_adjudicated is recorded both when a 2-1 split is resolved against the majority and when a required concept set had to be settled beyond token majority. No turn in this suite was resolved against a route or rating majority; all five tier_3 turns are concept-set adjudications, four of them (V322-005, V322-006, V322-007, V322-009) because the third family routed Intake and so contributed no revision requirements, and one (V322-018) because two singleton revision tokens were promoted on the merits under unanimous Red ratings.",
