  "statement": "I adjudicated the three independent gold label sets as the fourth model family rather than relabeling the holdout from scratch. No family's vote was discarded: every family's route, ratings, concept sets, critical invariants and rationale are preserved verbatim per turn in adjudication-v322-raw.json, and every departure from a family position is recorded with its tier and reasoning. I read only the ten allowlisted paths, opened only the two listed PNGs, did not guess the occluded V322-008 value, did not run the scorer, and did not modify the labeler or Skill files. Work is confined to the dedicated branch cursor/v322-gold-adjudicator-claude-17a0."
